# Planted bugs in the policy containment check. Each one must make the named check miss its expectation.
run fv-z3 policy.py
properties TightenedPolicyAllowsNothingTheOldOneDenied
file policy.py

mutation the new policy picks up delete by mistake
detects TightenedPolicyAllowsNothingTheOldOneDenied
-     return And(region == 0, action == 0)
+     return And(region == 0, Or(action == 0, action == 2))

mutation the old policy loses read, outside the rule that is under review
detects TightenedPolicyAllowsNothingTheOldOneDenied
-     return And(Or(region == 0, region == 1), Or(action == 0, action == 1))
+     return And(Or(region == 0, region == 1), action == 1)

harmless a comment is reworded
- """The policy in force today: us or eu, read or write."""
+ """The policy as deployed today: us or eu, read or write."""
